<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" data-theme="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> - <%= appName %></title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-layout">
  <%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>
  <div class="main-content">
    <%- include('../partials/topbar') %>
    <main class="page-content">
      <div class="page-header">
        <div class="page-header-left">
          <h1>Modul RADIUS</h1>
          <p style="margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:13px;">CRM tes/sync MySQL lewat <code>127.0.0.1</code>. Auth PPPoE baru lewat billing setelah daemon FreeRADIUS di <code>192.168.22.9</code> mengarah ke MySQL <code>192.168.22.99</code>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px;" id="sqlGuideCard">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px;">
            <div>
              <strong>Arahkan SQL FreeRADIUS (22.9) ke billing 192.168.22.99</strong>
              <p style="margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:13px;max-width:720px;">Langkah di bawah dikerjakan di server daloRADIUS/FreeRADIUS (<span class="mono" id="gDaemon">192.168.22.9</span>). Agent tidak punya SSH ke host itu — salin snippet, lalu tes dari 22.9.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="toggleSqlPass()">Tampilkan password</button>
              <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" type="button" onclick="copySqlSnippet()">Salin blok SQL</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ol id="sqlGuideSteps" style="margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:20px;color:var(--text);font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;">
            <li>Di billing, TCP 3306 hanya dibuka dari 192.168.22.9 (bukan ke internet).</li>
            <li>Dari 22.9, tes: <code class="mono" id="gMysqlTest">mysql -h 192.168.22.99 -u radius -p radius</code></li>
            <li>Edit <code>/etc/freeradius/3.0/mods-available/sql</code> — <code>server</code> = 192.168.22.99, user/db <code>radius</code>, <code>read_clients = yes</code>.</li>
            <li>Enable modul SQL, cek config, restart FreeRADIUS (perintah di bawah).</li>
            <li>Samakan host MySQL di <code>daloradius.conf.php</code> supaya UI daloRADIUS melihat user/sesi yang sama.</li>
            <li>Di MikroTik: <code>/radius</code> ke 192.168.22.9, secret sama dengan Modul NAS; <code>/ppp aaa use-radius=yes</code>.</li>
            <li>Kembali ke halaman ini → Tes MySQL, lalu Refresh sesi setelah PPPoE login.</li>
          </ol>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:12px;">
            <div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;">
                <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);">mods-available/sql</span>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="copySqlSnippet()">Salin</button>
              </div>
              <pre id="gSql" class="radius-guide-pre">Memuat…</pre>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;">
                <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);">Enable + tes MySQL</span>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="copyGuideField('gEnable')">Salin</button>
              </div>
              <pre id="gEnable" class="radius-guide-pre">Memuat…</pre>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;">
                <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);">daloRADIUS PHP</span>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="copyGuideField('gPhp')">Salin</button>
              </div>
              <pre id="gPhp" class="radius-guide-pre">Memuat…</pre>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;">
                <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);">MikroTik</span>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="copyGuideField('gMk')">Salin</button>
              </div>
              <pre id="gMk" class="radius-guide-pre">Memuat…</pre>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p id="gNotes" style="margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:12px;"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <style>
        .radius-guide-pre{margin:0;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-hover);border:1px solid var(--border);font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.45;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all;color:var(--text);max-height:220px;overflow:auto;}
      </style>

      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;">
            <strong>Server FreeRADIUS</strong>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
              <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="ensureLocal()">Pakai MySQL lokal</button>
              <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" type="button" onclick="openSrv()">+ Server</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <table class="data-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Nama</th><th>Host</th><th>MySQL</th><th>Status tes</th><th></th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="srvTable"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
        <div class="card-body">
          <strong>Sesi online (radacct)</strong>
          <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" style="margin-left:8px;" onclick="loadSessions()">Refresh</button>
          <table class="data-table" style="margin-top:10px;">
            <thead><tr><th>User</th><th>NAS</th><th>IP</th><th>Mulai</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="sessTable"><tr><td colspan="4" style="padding:16px;color:#94a3b8;">Klik refresh setelah tes koneksi berhasil</td></tr></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-body">
          <strong>User di radcheck</strong>
          <table class="data-table" style="margin-top:10px;">
            <thead><tr><th>Username</th><th>Password</th><th>Auth-Type</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="userTable"><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:16px;color:#94a3b8;">—</td></tr></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</div>
<div id="srvModal" style="display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.4);z-index:1000;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
  <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;width:100%;max-width:480px;max-height:90vh;overflow:auto;">
    <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px;">Server RADIUS</h3>
    <label style="font-size:13px;">Nama</label>
    <input id="sName" value="daloRADIUS" style="width:100%;margin:6px 0 8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;">
    <label style="font-size:13px;">Host FreeRADIUS</label>
    <input id="sHost" value="192.168.22.9" style="width:100%;margin:6px 0 8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;">
    <label style="font-size:13px;">MySQL host</label>
    <input id="sMysql" value="127.0.0.1" style="width:100%;margin:6px 0 8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;">
    <label style="font-size:13px;">Database</label>
    <input id="sDb" value="radius" style="width:100%;margin:6px 0 8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;">
    <label style="font-size:13px;">User MySQL</label>
    <input id="sUser" value="radius" style="width:100%;margin:6px 0 8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;">
    <label style="font-size:13px;">Password MySQL (schema radius / daloRADIUS)</label>
    <input id="sPass" type="password" style="width:100%;margin:6px 0 12px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;">
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;">
      <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="document.getElementById('srvModal').style.display='none'">Batal</button>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="saveSrv()">Simpan</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="/js/app.js"></script>
<script src="/js/radius.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
